#==============================================================================================
#
#   shorthand_style_value_1 - ShorthandStyleValue: a shorthand's longhand values, and serializing them
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/CSS/StyleValues/ShorthandStyleValue.cpp (lines 1-193, 864-991) and the
#       inline members of ShorthandStyleValue.h (lines 1-48). serialize is one switch in C++; each
#       case with more than a few lines is a function of its own in shorthand_style_value_2, in the
#       switch's order, and the lambdas are functions named after them.
